ogle.com" target="_blank">Google Fonts</a> and all <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/css_websafe_fonts.asp" target="_blank">web safe fonts</a>.'=>'請指派要使用的字型。Chaplin 支援 <a href="https://fonts.google.com" target="_blank">Google Fonts</a> 的全部字型，以及各種<a href="https://www.w3schools.com/cssref/css_websafe_fonts.asp" target="_blank">網頁字型安全組合</a>。','Fonts'=>'字型','Scales the logo to half its uploaded size, making it sharp on high-res screens.'=>'將標誌縮放至上傳時的一半尺寸，使其顯示在高解析度螢幕上時更加銳利。','Retina logo'=>'Retina 標誌','By Post Author'=>'文章作者的回覆','Edit'=>'編輯','Your comment is awaiting moderation.'=>'你的留言正在等候審閱。','%1$s at %2$s'=>'%1$s%2$s','%s <span class="screen-reader-text says">says:</span>'=>'%s<span class="screen-reader-text says">表示:</span>','Related Posts'=>'相關內容','Older Comments'=>'較舊的留言','Newer Comments'=>'較新的留言','Translators: %s = the number of comments%s Comment'=>'%s 則留言','https://andersnoren.se/teman/chaplin-wordpress-theme/'=>'https://andersnoren.se/teman/chaplin-wordpress-theme/','https://andersnoren.se'=>'https://andersnoren.se','Anders Norén'=>'Anders Norén']];